WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.782
"This show is terrible," said Terrell.

2
00:00:05.783 --> 00:00:09.477
Terrell, Mara, and Jack were still watching Mr. Presto.

3
00:00:09.478 --> 00:00:15.387
The magician had just made an old man's cane disappear.

4
00:00:15.388 --> 00:00:18.813
"Where's Mighty Man?" asked Jack.

5
00:00:18.814 --> 00:00:27.281
Suddenly Mara shouted. "Rocket Girl is on TV!"

6
00:00:27.282 --> 00:00:31.011
Detective Smith and the TV crew were still watching the monitor.

7
00:00:31.012 --> 00:00:34.088
"Whoa!" said the Mighty Man actor.

8
00:00:34.089 --> 00:00:36.639
"It's Rocket Girl!"

9
00:00:36.640 --> 00:00:40.842
Mr. Presto was about to make a little girl's lollipop disappear.

10
00:00:40.843 --> 00:00:44.205
"One, two, three . . ."

11
00:00:44.206 --> 00:00:48.040
"Stop right there, Mr. Presto!" Roxy yelled.

12
00:00:48.041 --> 00:00:52.198
Mr. Presto spun around, and the little girl ran away.

13
00:00:52.199 --> 00:00:55.705
"Rocket Girl!" said Mr. Presto.

14
00:00:55.706 --> 00:00:57.908
"I was hoping you would appear.

15
00:00:57.909 --> 00:01:01.209
Now my show will be very exciting!"

16
00:01:01.210 --> 00:01:04.589
"Your show is over," said Roxy.

17
00:01:04.590 --> 00:01:06.648
Mr. Presto smiled.

18
00:01:06.649 --> 00:01:08.842
"Oh no, it's not!

19
00:01:08.843 --> 00:01:12.673
In a moment I'll perform my most amazing trick.

20
00:01:12.674 --> 00:01:17.839
I'm going to make all the money in Metro City Bank disappear!"

21
00:01:17.840 --> 00:01:21.029
"No, you're not," said Roxy.

22
00:01:21.030 --> 00:01:23.626
Mr. Presto raised an eyebrow.

23
00:01:23.627 --> 00:01:27.614
"I'm not? Who's going to stop me?"

24
00:01:27.615 --> 00:01:31.774
"I am," said Roxy.

25
00:01:31.775 --> 00:01:34.583
She ran toward Mr. Presto.

26
00:01:34.584 --> 00:01:38.572
Mr. Presto waved his wand. "Presto!"

27
00:01:38.573 --> 00:01:41.657
A wall appeared in front of Roxy.

28
00:01:41.658 --> 00:01:44.685
Bam! Roxy crashed into it.

29
00:01:44.686 --> 00:01:48.067
Mr. Presto laughed.

30
00:01:48.068 --> 00:01:52.799
"This is turning out to be such a great show!"

31
00:01:52.800 --> 00:01:56.528
"Grr!" Roxy growled, rubbing her head.

32
00:01:56.529 --> 00:02:01.138
She jumped over the wall and landed in front of Mr. Presto.

33
00:02:01.139 --> 00:02:03.154
She tried to grab him.

34
00:02:03.155 --> 00:02:05.853
"Presto!" said the magician.

35
00:02:05.854 --> 00:02:08.869
Poof! He disappeared.

36
00:02:08.870 --> 00:02:11.485
Roxy looked from side to side.

37
00:02:11.486 --> 00:02:14.822
"Where did Mr. Presto go?" she wondered.

38
00:02:14.823 --> 00:02:17.832
She took a few steps, looking carefully.

39
00:02:17.833 --> 00:02:20.835
She felt someone tap her on the shoulder.

40
00:02:20.836 --> 00:02:23.857
"Here I am!" said Mr. Presto.

41
00:02:23.858 --> 00:02:25.668
Roxy spun around.

42
00:02:25.669 --> 00:02:29.608
Poof! Mr. Presto disappeared again.

43
00:02:29.609 --> 00:02:32.499
Roxy didn't see the magician anywhere.

44
00:02:32.500 --> 00:02:35.139
"Hey!" she yelled.

45
00:02:35.140 --> 00:02:39.022
"Mr. Presto! Why don't you come out and face me?

46
00:02:39.023 --> 00:02:41.578
Or are you too scared?"

47
00:02:41.579 --> 00:02:44.964
Poof! Mr. Presto appeared nearby.

48
00:02:44.965 --> 00:02:49.611
"I'm the world's greatest magician!" said Mr. Presto.

49
00:02:49.612 --> 00:02:56.787
"I'm not scared of a silly little girl."

50
00:02:56.788 --> 00:02:59.253
Roxy glared at Mr. Presto.

51
00:02:59.254 --> 00:03:01.882
"A silly little girl?

52
00:03:01.883 --> 00:03:05.006
You're going to regret saying that!"

53
00:03:05.007 --> 00:03:08.352
Roxy shot toward Mr. Presto like a rocket.

54
00:03:08.353 --> 00:03:11.533
"Presto!" said Mr. Presto.

55
00:03:11.534 --> 00:03:14.281
A big black box appeared in front of him.

56
00:03:14.282 --> 00:03:17.211
Roxy was flying too fast to stop.

57
00:03:17.212 --> 00:03:19.557
She slammed right into the box.

58
00:03:19.558 --> 00:03:22.414
Mr. Presto quickly closed it shut.

59
00:03:22.415 --> 00:03:26.087
"One, two, three . . . Presto!"

60
00:03:26.088 --> 00:03:29.307
Mara, Jack, and Terrell stared at the TV screen.

61
00:03:29.308 --> 00:03:31.244
They all gasped.

62
00:03:31.245 --> 00:03:37.187
"Uh-oh!" cried Terrell.

